  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mother school society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSS will target 60 working women in the illegal settlements in the targeted sites (Tammoun, Tubas, and Balata refugee camp) with mental health and psycho-social support (MHPSS) and food parcels, and additional 20 women with food parcels (80 women total).Key stakeholders will be engaged in relevant discussion, such as local councils, CBOs, relevant government ministries, and NGO groups.
However, we will target 20 additional women in distributing food parcels. Thus, 60 targeted women in the project intervention and additional 20 (total 80) in providing food parcels and humanitarian aids.</narrative>
  </description>
